From: Chaos Ruler <zmelumian@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: chipone-icna35xx: full 12-bit brightness range

The top panel's backlight stopped at 3413. Measured on full white, its current was still
rising steeply there, and AYN's on-command starts the panel at 0xD75 (3445). Expose
the DCS range (4095).
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c
index 70ed769ddab5..0e96d2c0cc87 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-chipone-icna35xx.c
@@ -485,7 +485,12 @@ static struct backlight_device *icna35xx_create_backlight(struct mipi_dsi_device
 	const struct backlight_properties props = {
 		.type = BACKLIGHT_RAW,
 		.brightness = 3413,
-		.max_brightness = 3413,
+		/*
+		 * The 12-bit DCS range. 3413 was ROCKNIX's guess; on full white the Thor's panel
+		 * current was still climbing steeply there (2026-10-29), and AYN's own on-command
+		 * starts at 0xD75 (3445).
+		 */
+		.max_brightness = 4095,
 	};
 
 	return devm_backlight_device_register(dev, dev_name(dev), dev, dsi,
